+<main>
+<section class="shell hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Simple, people-first pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">Make room for<br>better conversations.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to stay in sync. No noise, no surprise fees—just space to do great work.</p><div class="billing"><span class="billing-label active" id="monthly-label">Monthly</span><button class="switch" id="billing-switch" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="monthly-label yearly-label"><span></span></button><span class="billing-label" id="yearly-label">Yearly</span><span class="save">Save 20%</span><span class="sr-only" id="billing-status" aria-live="polite">Monthly billing selected</span></div></section>
+<section class="shell plans" id="plans" aria-label="Plans and pricing">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="plan-desc">A calmer way for small teams to connect.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="0" data-yearly="0">$0</span><span class="price-period">/ user / month</span></div><p class="billed">Free forever</p><a class="cta secondary" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Get%20started%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started free</a><div class="includes">The essentials</div><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Unlimited messages</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Up to 10 members</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>3 searchable months</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>1:1 audio huddles</li></ul></article>
