+<section class="section" id="compare"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">At a glance</span><h2>Find your team's fit.</h2><p>Good conversations at every stage.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">Feature comparison across Relay plans</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Features</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col" class="highlight-col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audio &amp; video huddles</th><td>1:1</td><td class="highlight-col">Group</td><td>Group</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Apps &amp; integrations</th><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td class="highlight-col"><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">SAML single sign-on</th><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td class="highlight-col"><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced admin controls</th><td><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td class="highlight-col"><span class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Support</th><td>Community</td><td class="highlight-col">Standard</td><td>Priority</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="table-note">All prices are per user. Yearly plans are billed annually.</p></div></section>
+<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">Good to know</span><h2>Questions, answered.</h2><p>A few details to help you get started.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade or downgrade any time. When you upgrade, new features are available right away; downgrades take effect at the next billing period.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Yearly billing costs 20% less than paying month to month. We bill the full annual amount per user at the start of each year.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan is free forever and needs no credit card. Explore Relay with your team, then upgrade when you need more.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Add members whenever you need. Paid plans are priced per active user, so your plan can grow with your team.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving to Relay?</summary><p>We can help your team get set up and bring your conversations along. Reach out to our team and we'll work out the best path.</p></details></div></div></section>
